      "width": "380px",
      "text": "דְּלָא אָמַר לֵיהּ לְמִקְפָּה. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"4\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>הִלְכָּךְ, <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"0\" data-marker-letter=\"א\">א</span>״מַרְתֵּף שֶׁל יַיִן״ וְאָמַר",
