      "width": "655px",
      "text": "דְּאוֹקֵימְנָא דְּאָמַר לֵיהּ לְמִקְפָּה, הָא לָא אָמַר לֵיהּ לְמִקְפָּה – מְקַבֵּל! <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"10\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>הוּא הַדִּין דְּאַף עַל גַּב",
      "segment_ids": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "דְּלָא אָמַר לֵיהּ לְמִקְפָּה – לָא מְקַבֵּל, וְהַאי דְּאוֹקֵימְנָא דְּאָמַר לֵיהּ לְמִקְפָּה, מִשּׁוּם דְּקַשְׁיָא ״זֶה״",
      "segment_ids": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "אַ״זֶּה״. <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"339\" data-sentence-id=\"11\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"א\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"11\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Yehuda bar Yeḥezkel, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1394\" data-full-name=\"Rav Yehuda bar Yeḥezkel\" data-name-he=\"רב יהודה בר יחזקאל\">רַב יְהוּדָה</span>: יַיִן הַנִּמְכָּר בַּחֲנוּת – מְבָרְכִין עָלָיו ״בּוֹרֵא פְּרִי הַגֶּפֶן״. <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Ḥisda, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1345\" data-full-name=\"Rav Ḥisda\" data-name-he=\"רב חסדא\">וְרַב חִסְדָּא</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "אָמַר: גַּבֵּי חַמְרָא דְּאַקְרֵים לְמָה לִי? <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"12\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>מֵיתִיבִי: עַל הַפַּת שֶׁעִפְּשָׁה, וְעַל הַיַּיִן",
      "segment_ids": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "שֶׁהִקְרִים, וְעַל תַּבְשִׁיל שֶׁעִבְּרָה צוּרָתוֹ – אוֹמֵר ״שֶׁהַכֹּל נִהְיֶה בִּדְבָרוֹ״! <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"13\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Zevid, fifth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"993\" data-full-name=\"Rav Zevid\" data-name-he=\"רב זביד\">רַב זְבִיד</span>:",
      "segment_ids": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "מוֹדֶה <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Yehuda bar Yeḥezkel, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1394\" data-full-name=\"Rav Yehuda bar Yeḥezkel\" data-name-he=\"רב יהודה בר יחזקאל\">רַב יְהוּדָה</span> בְּפוּרְצְמָא דְּמִיזְדַּבַּן אַקַּרְנָתָא. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"14\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר לֵיהּ <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Abaye, fourth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"121\" data-full-name=\"Abaye\" data-name-he=\"אביי\">אַבָּיֵי</span> <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Yosef I, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1764\" data-full-name=\"Rav Yosef I\" data-name-he=\"רב יוסף בר חייא\">לְרַב יוֹסֵף</span>: הָא <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Yehuda bar Yeḥezkel, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1394\" data-full-name=\"Rav Yehuda bar Yeḥezkel\" data-name-he=\"רב יהודה בר יחזקאל\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-5869\">רַב</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "655px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Yehuda bar Yeḥezkel, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1394\" data-full-name=\"Rav Yehuda bar Yeḥezkel\" data-name-he=\"רב יהודה בר יחזקאל\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-5869\">יְהוּדָה</span>, הָא <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Ḥisda, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1345\" data-full-name=\"Rav Ḥisda\" data-name-he=\"רב חסדא\">רַב חִסְדָּא</span>; מָר כְּמַאן סְבִירָא לֵיהּ? אָמַר לֵיהּ: מַתְנִיתָא יָדַעְנָא.",
      "segment_ids": [
        14
      ]
    }
  ],
